return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Uza mwenyeji wa wavuti wa Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye tovuti yako mwenyewe ya WordPress — PBN isiyo na alama ya SEO, WordPress, WooCommerce, wakala, muuzaji upya, wingu na mwenyeji wa VPS. Tafuta na utoe vikoa kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya muuzaji upya, ingiza wateja wako moja kwa moja kwenye paneli yao ya mwenyeji, na uandae mwenyeji kiotomatiki wakati agizo la WooCommerce limelipwa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Jukwaa la mwenyeji limeshughulikia na hali %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Tafuta jina lako la kikoa','Search'=>'Tafuta','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Hakuna viongezeo vilivyoteuliwa kwa jina hilo.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Utafutaji wa vikoa haupatikani kwenye tovuti hii kwa sasa.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Hatukuweza kufikia sajili ya kikoa kwa sasa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'Ufunguo wa API haupo au hauna nguvu tena. Ukague chini ya